    verifier                       interactive: banner, key prompt, paste emails
    verifier a@b.com c@d.com       verify the given addresses
    verifier leads.csv             verify every address found in a file
    verifier --help                all options

Only the Python standard library is used, so it runs anywhere python3 does.
